# Manual test script for the Patient & Queue API.
# Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension (Huachao Mao) and click "Send Request"
# above each block, top to bottom. The app must be running: .\mvnw.cmd spring-boot:run
# Seeded departments on a fresh database: 1 = OPD, 2 = Emergency, 3 = Maternity

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@opd = 1

### 1. Register a patient  -> 201
# @name patientA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mwaba Banda",
  "age": 34,
  "sex": "FEMALE",
  "contact": "+260971234567",
  "bloodGroup": "O_POS"
}

### 2. Register a second patient  -> 201
# @name patientB
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Chanda Phiri",
  "age": 52,
  "sex": "MALE"
}

### 3. Validation error  -> 400 with fieldErrors
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "age": -1,
  "sex": "x"
}

### 4. Get patient A  -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{patientA.response.body.id}}

### 5. Search by name  -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients?name=banda

### 6. Ticket for patient A in OPD  -> 201, OPD-00x, position 1
# @name ticketA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/queue/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": {{patientA.response.body.id}},
  "departmentId": {{opd}}
}

### 7. Ticket for patient B in OPD  -> 201, position 2
# @name ticketB
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/queue/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": {{patientB.response.body.id}},
  "departmentId": {{opd}}
}

### 8. Duplicate active ticket for patient A  -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/queue/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": {{patientA.response.body.id}},
  "departmentId": {{opd}}
}

### 9. Triage flags patient B as EMERGENCY  -> 200, position 1
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/queue/tickets/{{ticketB.response.body.id}}/priority
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "priorityLevel": "EMERGENCY",
  "triageNotes": "Severe bleeding",
  "requiresBlood": true
}

### 10. Live OPD queue  -> patient B first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/queue/departments/{{opd}}

### 11. Call next  -> 200, patient B now IN_PROGRESS
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/queue/departments/{{opd}}/call-next

### 12. Complete patient B's consultation  -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/queue/tickets/{{ticketB.response.body.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED",
  "outcome": "Transfused 2 units, admitted to ward"
}

### 13. Invalid change: completed -> waiting  -> 409
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/queue/tickets/{{ticketB.response.body.id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "WAITING"
}

### 14. Today's OPD tickets that are still waiting  -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/queue/tickets?departmentId={{opd}}&status=WAITING

### 15. Get ticket A  -> 200, position 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/queue/tickets/{{ticketA.response.body.id}}
